    "synopsis": {
        "native": "A v\u00e1rosb\u00f3l kivezet\u0151 utakat lez\u00e1rt\u00e1k. Kij\u00e1r\u00e1si tilalom van \u00e9rv\u00e9nyben. Holttestek hevernek a kihalt utc\u00e1kon. A boltok \u00fcresek. Ahogy sok h\u00e1z is, mert lak\u00f3ik elmenek\u00fcltek, am\u00edg lehetett. Matthew itt maradt, hogy \u00e1polja beteg \u00e9desanyj\u00e1t, aki valamilyen rejt\u00e9lyes betegs\u00e9gben szenved. Egy nap v\u00e1ratlan dolog t\u00f6rt\u00e9nik: Matthew r\u00e9g elveszett apja, aki elhagyta a csal\u00e1dot, felbukkan. El akarja vinni fi\u00e1t a v\u00e1rosb\u00f3l, amelynek napjai meg vannak sz\u00e1ml\u00e1lva.",
        "english": "The roads leading out of the city are closed. There is a curfew. Dead bodies litter the deserted streets. Shops are empty. So are many houses, because their inhabitants fled while they could. Matthew has stayed behind to care for his sick mother, who is suffering from some mysterious illness. One day, the unexpected happens: Matthew's long-lost father, who had left the family, turns up. He wants to get his son out of the town, whose days are numbered."
